VF-TPL007: missing string template binding
Phase: semantic
Location: line 6, column 43
Found: id
Expected: binding for String.template
Hint:
Named string templates require exact bindings.

Every `${name}` placeholder must have a matching `name: value` binding, every binding must be used, and each binding name may appear only once.

Example:
    String.template("name=${name}", name: user_name)
